### 查列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events

### 查详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/1

### 查一个不存在的
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/999

### 新建活动
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "HTTP 文件测试",
  "description": "用 .http 发的",
  "totalStock": 100,
  "availableStock": 100,
  "startTime": "2026-11-01T19:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-11-01T21:00:00"
}

### 更新活动（PUT 是整体替换，字段要写全）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/events/6
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "改过名字了",
  "description": "updated",
  "totalStock": 30,
  "availableStock": 30,
  "startTime": "2026-11-01T19:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-11-01T21:00:00"
}

### 删除活动
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/events/6

### 创建活动 - 校验失败用例
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "校验测试",
  "description": "totalStock 为 0",
  "totalStock": 0,
  "availableStock": 0,
  "startTime": "2026-12-01T19:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-12-01T21:00:00"
}

### 分页 - 第1页
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events?page=1&size=2

### 分页 - 第3页（最后一页）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events?page=3&size=2

### 分页 - 第4页（超出范围）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events?page=4&size=2

### 分页 - size 超上限（应被压到 100）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events?page=1&size=1000

### 分页 - page 非法（应被纠正为 1）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events?page=0&size=2